WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,501
How to report a case, step by step.

2
00:00:02,501 --> 00:00:09,247
Open traccia.it.com, and choose «Report a case». You don't need to create an account.

3
00:00:09,247 --> 00:00:13,392
The form asks for six things, and nothing more.

4
00:00:13,392 --> 00:00:21,118
The first two are your first name and your last name: the engagement contract needs them separately.

5
00:00:21,118 --> 00:00:26,555
Then your email: it's the address we'll reply to. Check you've written it correctly.

6
00:00:26,555 --> 00:00:37,731
Your phone, with the country code: someone who has just lost money shouldn't wait for an email, and this way we can call you from abroad too.

7
00:00:37,731 --> 00:00:44,157
The approximate amount lost, in euro. Rough is fine: it tells us what kind of case this is.

8
00:00:44,157 --> 00:00:54,499
On recovery: we trace where the money went, with technical proof. From there we say where it ended up and whether a route exists.

9
00:00:54,499 --> 00:01:04,490
Sometimes it can be done: the money is still traceable. Sometimes it cannot, and we say so at once. Nobody can promise the result: we can promise the method.

10
00:01:04,490 --> 00:01:17,980
Then choose what happened to you: a fake broker, cryptocurrency fraud, money asked to unlock a withdrawal, a fake fund recovery service, or «I don't know yet».

11
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:31,380
No password. You are sending a request, not opening an account: nothing to remember. An analyst reads what you wrote and calls you back within forty-eight working hours, on the number you gave us.

12
00:01:31,380 --> 00:01:40,670
And if someone asks for more money to recover yours, stop: that's the second scam. Traccia never asks for an advance.
